  "id": "ibs",
  "term": "IBS",
  "definition": "IBS, or irritable bowel syndrome, is the best-known disorder of gut-brain interaction and is grouped into constipation-predominant, diarrhoea-predominant, mixed, and unclassified forms based on bowel habit problems. Its causes are described as multifactorial, with genetic, immune, environmental, psychosocial, and brain-gut factors all implicated, and it is often studied in relation to gut-specific anxiety and symptom severity.",
